# A KICK of ourselves says it will rejoin, and sends one JOIN three seconds
# later with the configured key. A second wake does not send it again, and
# the server's JOIN ends the wait. (Textual's joinKickedChannel, with its
# "RejoinChannelOnLocalKick" preference on; kick-no-rejoin.irc has it off,
# the default.)
= rejoin-on-kick on
= autojoin #c:sekrit
! welcome
< :textual!u@h JOIN #c
> MODE #c
< :op!o@h KICK #c textual :bye
? line-before #c op kicked textual from the channel (bye)
? line #c Attempting to rejoin channel in three seconds
? parted #c
? rejoin #c 3s
? next-wake 3s
@ +2.999s
? rejoin #c 0.001s
@ +1ms
> JOIN #c sekrit
? rejoin #c on-connect
? next-wake 267s
@ +10s
? lines #c 3
< :textual!u@h JOIN #c
> MODE #c
? joined #c
? next-wake 270s
? registered textual
